{"attribution":"Federal Trade Commission, How to Avoid a Scam, Simplified Chinese, July 2023; no FTC endorsement or affiliation is implied.","cases":[{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ftc-how-to-avoid-scam-simplified-v1/sentence-001","input":"诈骗者假装来自于您知道的组织。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://consumer.ftc.gov/system/files/consumer_ftc_gov/pdf/How-to-avoid-a-scam_Chinese-Simplified_August2023.pdf","source_case_id":"sentence-001","split":"handout"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ftc-how-to-avoid-scam-simplified-v1/sentence-002","input":"诈骗者通常假装代表政府联系您。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://consumer.ftc.gov/system/files/consumer_ftc_gov/pdf/How-to-avoid-a-scam_Chinese-Simplified_August2023.pdf","source_case_id":"sentence-002","split":"handout"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ftc-how-to-avoid-scam-simplified-v1/sentence-003","input":"他们可能会假借某个真实机构的名称，比如 FTC （联邦贸易委员会）、 Social Security Administration （社会保障局）、 IRS （国税局）或 Medicare，或捏造一个听起来很正式的机构名称。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://consumer.ftc.gov/system/files/consumer_ftc_gov/pdf/How-to-avoid-a-scam_Chinese-Simplified_August2023.pdf","source_case_id":"sentence-003","split":"handout"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ftc-how-to-avoid-scam-simplified-v1/sentence-004","input":"有些人假装来自您知道的企业，例如，公用事业公司、科技公司或者甚至是要求捐款的慈善机构。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://consumer.ftc.gov/system/files/consumer_ftc_gov/pdf/How-to-avoid-a-scam_Chinese-Simplified_August2023.pdf","source_case_id":"sentence-004","split":"handout"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ftc-how-to-avoid-scam-simplified-v1/sentence-005","input":"他们使用技术来更改来电显示上的电话号码。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://consumer.ftc.gov/system/files/consumer_ftc_gov/pdf/How-to-avoid-a-scam_Chinese-Simplified_August2023.pdf","source_case_id":"sentence-005","split":"handout"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ftc-how-to-avoid-scam-simplified-v1/sentence-006","input":"因此，您看到的名称和号码可能不是真实的。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://consumer.ftc.gov/system/files/consumer_ftc_gov/pdf/How-to-avoid-a-scam_Chinese-Simplified_August2023.pdf","source_case_id":"sentence-006","split":"handout"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ftc-how-to-avoid-scam-simplified-v1/sentence-007","input":"诈骗者迫使您立即采取行动。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://consumer.ftc.gov/system/files/consumer_ftc_gov/pdf/How-to-avoid-a-scam_Chinese-Simplified_August2023.pdf","source_case_id":"sentence-007","split":"handout"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ftc-how-to-avoid-scam-simplified-v1/sentence-008","input":"诈骗者希望您在有时间思考之前就采取行动。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://consumer.ftc.gov/system/files/consumer_ftc_gov/pdf/How-to-avoid-a-scam_Chinese-Simplified_August2023.pdf","source_case_id":"sentence-008","split":"handout"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ftc-how-to-avoid-scam-simplified-v1/sentence-009","input":"如果您接听了他们的电话，可能会被告知不要挂断，这样您就无法验证事实。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://consumer.ftc.gov/system/files/consumer_ftc_gov/pdf/How-to-avoid-a-scam_Chinese-Simplified_August2023.pdf","source_case_id":"sentence-009","split":"handout"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ftc-how-to-avoid-scam-simplified-v1/sentence-010","input":"他们可能会威胁要逮捕您、起诉您、吊销您的驾照或营业执照，或将您驱逐出境。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://consumer.ftc.gov/system/files/consumer_ftc_gov/pdf/How-to-avoid-a-scam_Chinese-Simplified_August2023.pdf","source_case_id":"sentence-010","split":"handout"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ftc-how-to-avoid-scam-simplified-v1/sentence-011","input":"他们可能会说您的计算机即将损坏。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://consumer.ftc.gov/system/files/consumer_ftc_gov/pdf/How-to-avoid-a-scam_Chinese-Simplified_August2023.pdf","source_case_id":"sentence-011","split":"handout"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ftc-how-to-avoid-scam-simplified-v1/sentence-012","input":"诈骗者通知您要用特定的方式付款。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://consumer.ftc.gov/system/files/consumer_ftc_gov/pdf/How-to-avoid-a-scam_Chinese-Simplified_August2023.pdf","source_case_id":"sentence-012","split":"handout"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ftc-how-to-avoid-scam-simplified-v1/sentence-013","input":"他们通常坚持要求您仅可通过加密货币、通过 MoneyGram 或 Western Union 等公司汇款、使用支付应用程序、或将钱存入礼品卡并在卡片背面写上金额的方式来付款。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://consumer.ftc.gov/system/files/consumer_ftc_gov/pdf/How-to-avoid-a-scam_Chinese-Simplified_August2023.pdf","source_case_id":"sentence-013","split":"handout"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ftc-how-to-avoid-scam-simplified-v1/sentence-014","input":"有些诈骗者会给您邮寄一张支票（其实是假支票），然后告诉您去银行存入，并把钱汇给他们。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://consumer.ftc.gov/system/files/consumer_ftc_gov/pdf/How-to-avoid-a-scam_Chinese-Simplified_August2023.pdf","source_case_id":"sentence-014","split":"handout"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ftc-how-to-avoid-scam-simplified-v1/sentence-015","input":"诈骗者说有问题或奖励。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://consumer.ftc.gov/system/files/consumer_ftc_gov/pdf/How-to-avoid-a-scam_Chinese-Simplified_August2023.pdf","source_case_id":"sentence-015","split":"handout"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ftc-how-to-avoid-scam-simplified-v1/sentence-016","input":"他们可能会说您在政府关系方面遇到麻烦、或您欠了钱，或您家里有人发生紧急情况。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://consumer.ftc.gov/system/files/consumer_ftc_gov/pdf/How-to-avoid-a-scam_Chinese-Simplified_August2023.pdf","source_case_id":"sentence-016","split":"handout"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ftc-how-to-avoid-scam-simplified-v1/sentence-017","input":"或者您的计算机感染了病毒。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://consumer.ftc.gov/system/files/consumer_ftc_gov/pdf/How-to-avoid-a-scam_Chinese-Simplified_August2023.pdf","source_case_id":"sentence-017","split":"handout"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ftc-how-to-avoid-scam-simplified-v1/sentence-018","input":"有的诈骗者会说您的某个账户有问题，需要验证一些信息。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://consumer.ftc.gov/system/files/consumer_ftc_gov/pdf/How-to-avoid-a-scam_Chinese-Simplified_August2023.pdf","source_case_id":"sentence-018","split":"handout"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ftc-how-to-avoid-scam-simplified-v1/sentence-019","input":"而其他诈骗者则会撒谎，说您在彩票或抽奖活动中中奖，但必须支付一定费用才能获得该奖励。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://consumer.ftc.gov/system/files/consumer_ftc_gov/pdf/How-to-avoid-a-scam_Chinese-Simplified_August2023.pdf","source_case_id":"sentence-019","split":"handout"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ftc-how-to-avoid-scam-simplified-v1/sentence-020","input":"屏蔽骚扰电话和短信。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://consumer.ftc.gov/system/files/consumer_ftc_gov/pdf/How-to-avoid-a-scam_Chinese-Simplified_August2023.pdf","source_case_id":"sentence-020","split":"handout"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ftc-how-to-avoid-scam-simplified-v1/sentence-021","input":"采取措施，阻止骚扰的来电并过滤骚扰的短信。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://consumer.ftc.gov/system/files/consumer_ftc_gov/pdf/How-to-avoid-a-scam_Chinese-Simplified_August2023.pdf","source_case_id":"sentence-021","split":"handout"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ftc-how-to-avoid-scam-simplified-v1/sentence-022","input":"请勿根据意料之外的要求提供您的个人或财务信息。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://consumer.ftc.gov/system/files/consumer_ftc_gov/pdf/How-to-avoid-a-scam_Chinese-Simplified_August2023.pdf","source_case_id":"sentence-022","split":"handout"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ftc-how-to-avoid-scam-simplified-v1/sentence-023","input":"诚信组织不会通过打电话、发电邮或发短信的方式来要求您提供个人信息（例如，您的社会保障号码、银行账户或信用卡号）。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://consumer.ftc.gov/system/files/consumer_ftc_gov/pdf/How-to-avoid-a-scam_Chinese-Simplified_August2023.pdf","source_case_id":"sentence-023","split":"handout"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ftc-how-to-avoid-scam-simplified-v1/sentence-024","input":"就算您收到与您有业务来往的公司的电子邮件和短信，而且您相信其真实性，最好也不要点击任何链接。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://consumer.ftc.gov/system/files/consumer_ftc_gov/pdf/How-to-avoid-a-scam_Chinese-Simplified_August2023.pdf","source_case_id":"sentence-024","split":"handout"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ftc-how-to-avoid-scam-simplified-v1/sentence-025","input":"相反，请使用您知道的值得信赖的网站联系他们、或查询他们的电话号码。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://consumer.ftc.gov/system/files/consumer_ftc_gov/pdf/How-to-avoid-a-scam_Chinese-Simplified_August2023.pdf","source_case_id":"sentence-025","split":"handout"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ftc-how-to-avoid-scam-simplified-v1/sentence-026","input":"请勿拨打他们给您的电话号码或来电显示号码。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://consumer.ftc.gov/system/files/consumer_ftc_gov/pdf/How-to-avoid-a-scam_Chinese-Simplified_August2023.pdf","source_case_id":"sentence-026","split":"handout"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ftc-how-to-avoid-scam-simplified-v1/sentence-027","input":"顶住立即采取行动的压力。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://consumer.ftc.gov/system/files/consumer_ftc_gov/pdf/How-to-avoid-a-scam_Chinese-Simplified_August2023.pdf","source_case_id":"sentence-027","split":"handout"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ftc-how-to-avoid-scam-simplified-v1/sentence-028","input":"诚信企业会给您时间来做出决定。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://consumer.ftc.gov/system/files/consumer_ftc_gov/pdf/How-to-avoid-a-scam_Chinese-Simplified_August2023.pdf","source_case_id":"sentence-028","split":"handout"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ftc-how-to-avoid-scam-simplified-v1/sentence-029","input":"任何强迫您付款或向其提供您个人信息的人员都是诈骗者。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://consumer.ftc.gov/system/files/consumer_ftc_gov/pdf/How-to-avoid-a-scam_Chinese-Simplified_August2023.pdf","source_case_id":"sentence-029","split":"handout"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ftc-how-to-avoid-scam-simplified-v1/sentence-030","input":"了解诈骗者通知您付款的方式。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://consumer.ftc.gov/system/files/consumer_ftc_gov/pdf/How-to-avoid-a-scam_Chinese-Simplified_August2023.pdf","source_case_id":"sentence-030","split":"handout"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ftc-how-to-avoid-scam-simplified-v1/sentence-031","input":"切勿向坚持要求您仅可通过加密货币、 MoneyGram 或 Western Union 等公司的电汇服务、用支付应用程序或礼品卡付款的人员付款、并且切勿存入支票并随后将款项返回给某人。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://consumer.ftc.gov/system/files/consumer_ftc_gov/pdf/How-to-avoid-a-scam_Chinese-Simplified_August2023.pdf","source_case_id":"sentence-031","split":"handout"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ftc-how-to-avoid-scam-simplified-v1/sentence-032","input":"停下来，并与您信任的人谈一谈。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://consumer.ftc.gov/system/files/consumer_ftc_gov/pdf/How-to-avoid-a-scam_Chinese-Simplified_August2023.pdf","source_case_id":"sentence-032","split":"handout"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ftc-how-to-avoid-scam-simplified-v1/sentence-033","input":"在您采取其他任何行动之前，请告诉您信任的人 - 朋友、家人或邻居 - 发生了何事。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://consumer.ftc.gov/system/files/consumer_ftc_gov/pdf/How-to-avoid-a-scam_Chinese-Simplified_August2023.pdf","source_case_id":"sentence-033","split":"handout"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ftc-how-to-avoid-scam-simplified-v1/sentence-034","input":"谈论此事的来龙去脉也许可以帮助您意识到这是一个骗局。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://consumer.ftc.gov/system/files/consumer_ftc_gov/pdf/How-to-avoid-a-scam_Chinese-Simplified_August2023.pdf","source_case_id":"sentence-034","split":"handout"}}],"converter_output_used":false,"dataset":"blind-v2","id":"ftc-how-to-avoid-scam-simplified-v1","input_only":true,"license":"U.S. Public Domain","modification_notice":"Extracted only complete Simplified Chinese prose sentences from the checksum-pinned FTC-authored PDF, joined PDF layout wraps, removed headings, page furniture, contact instructions, URLs, bullet glyphs, and incomplete list fragments, and added input-only provenance; no images, seals, expected text, or converter output were used.","purpose":"candidate_source_pilot","review_policy":"domain_and_risk_must_be_assigned_from_input_only","source_class":"public_domain","stats":{"by_split":{"handout":34},"eligible_pending_review":34,"exclusions":{},"raw_cases":34},"upstream_revision":"FTC How to Avoid a Scam, Simplified Chinese, July 2023; PDF Last-Modified 2023-11-29T22:20:42Z; raw SHA-256: 78720bc248bced72d951e2d72902c6957fc33bb3eefedb2b8df1e31babef8804","version":1}
